EXPERIMENT-2: Distributed Application using CORBA (Calculator)

Steps to Run:

1.Compile IDL file:
idlj -fall Calculator.idl <- run this in terminal

2.Compile Java files
javac CalculatorModule/*.java *.java  <- run this in terminal

3.Start Naming Service (in one terminal)
tnameserv -ORBInitialPort 1050 <- run this in terminal

4.Start Server (in new terminal)
java Server -ORBInitialPort 1050 <- run this in terminal

5.Start Client (in new terminal)
java Client -ORBInitialPort 1050 <- run this in terminal